      "cooked": "<p>Earlier today I was playing the Steam Version with the Prime Wardens to try unlock PW AA. I had several Limbs underneath Savage Mana and then put End of Days into play. When End of Days destroyed Savage Mana, I was expecting the damage against Akash to be dealt from each Limb as they were destroyed. However they just got put into her trash and no damage was dealt. Is that the right ruling? Was it because End of Days destroyed Savage Mana and would have using Savage Mana's power to destroy the Limbs beneath it, triggered their damage?</p>",
